    674  2dd9							; tremolo LFO, every 10 ms: tremA = 0-15. The sound's own (NES pulses with
    675  2dd9							; an envelope), the menu's TREMOLO ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values) or TREMOLO
    676  2dd9							; held (SPACE / a button): those two also move the SID's volume and the NES
    677  2dd9							; pulses of sounds without an envelope (held on a sound with none: the
    678  2dd9							; ADVANCED SOUND values). TREMOLO OFF: none. The Game Boy has no tremolo yet.
